  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 2nd level, a wildcard gains a pool of fate points, which measures his capacity to follow and manipulate the skeins of fate. Given this sort of work requires actual understanding of how the world works rather than sheer force of will, the number of points in a wildcard's fate pool is equal to 1/2 his wildcard level + his Wisdom modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wildcard#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
